<speak>Yes, I am willing to accept that loss. I would rather release the money for my household commitments than keep waiting for a recovery. I've set aside my notes for the practical discussion as well. I don't want to spend the whole afternoon shuffling between different piles, so the pages for this call are together now. After we finish, I can put them away and actually be present with the family. That sounds like a small thing, but lately I've noticed how often I say I'm finished with work while still carrying a notebook around the house and answering messages from the corridor.</speak>